      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the info. i'm just really trying to avoid the hospital if i can since the last time i went it took like 8 hours and it was so stressful. do you think it could just be the heat or maybe just being dehydrated? i can probably just drink more water and rest for a few days and see if it goes away, right?",
